WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.510
While striving for the Chinese Dream, young people enjoy more opportunities to realize their self-worth.
在为实现中国梦而奋斗的过程中，年轻人拥有更多实现自我价值的机会。

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:20.140
As the country develops rapidly, fields such as science and technology, rural development and cultural innovation are opening their doors wide to young talent.
随着国家的快速发展，科技、乡村发展、文化创新等领域正在向年轻人才敞开大门。

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:25.820
Today’s young people have more ways than ever to turn their abilities into achievements.
如今的年轻人比以往任何时候都有更多途径把自己的能力转化为成就。

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:28.900
These opportunities come in many forms.
这些机会有多种形式。

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:39.110
Young researchers are taking part in major national projects, from space exploration to new energy, and many of them are making their mark at an early age.
年轻的科研人员正在参与从太空探索到新能源等国家重大项目，其中许多人年纪轻轻就崭露头角。

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:48.750
Others are returning to their hometowns to start businesses, selling local products online, creating jobs and helping their neighbors earn a better living.
还有一些人回到家乡创业，在网上销售当地特产，创造就业岗位，帮助乡亲们过上更好的生活。

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:56.540
In contributing to their country’s growth, they also find a sense of purpose and achievement that money alone cannot bring.
在为国家发展作贡献的过程中，他们也找到了单靠金钱无法带来的使命感和成就感。

00:00:57.340 --> 00:01:01.760
For them, personal success and national progress go hand in hand.
对他们来说，个人成功与国家进步是相辅相成的。

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:06.000
Of course, opportunity favors those who are prepared.
当然，机会总是青睐有准备的人。

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:14.150
Young people should study hard, think independently and have the courage to take on difficult tasks that others shy away from.
年轻人应努力学习、独立思考，并有勇气承担别人退缩不前的艰巨任务。

00:01:14.950 --> 00:01:22.990
Only by linking their personal dreams with the future of the nation can they truly realize their self-worth and contribute to the Chinese Dream.
只有把个人梦想与国家前途联系起来，他们才能真正实现自我价值，为中国梦作出贡献。
